     <td><para unique="1261291">B</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261293">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261298">AVX512F</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261300">Convert sixteen packed single precision floating-point values from zmm2/m512/m32bcst to sixteen packed signed doubleword values in zmm1 using truncation subject to writemask k1.</para>
